abstract: >-
  First hardware-verified deployment of an INT8 quantized ANN
  (mathematically equivalent to T=1 SNN inference) for network
  intrusion detection on the STM32N6570-DK Neural-ART NPU,
  achieving 0.4561ms inference latency at 800MHz.
  Includes QCFS activation comparison experiment revealing that
  the Floor operator falls back to CPU on Neural-ART NPU,
  confirming ReLU INT8 as the optimal deployment path for
  SNN-equivalent inference on general-purpose MCU NPUs.
